<!--
  ericw qbsp loads textures only from WADs listed on worldspawn "wad" (semicolon-separated
  filenames or absolute paths). -wadpath dirs are search roots for those names; they do not
  auto-include every .wad in a folder. Decompiled maps often omit "wad" — add it (see q1.game pack).
  WAD mip previews load palette via VFS path gfx/palette.lmp (see NetRadiant plugins/imagehl/mip.cpp).
  QE_InitVFS mounts EnginePath/<Game name>/ and EnginePath/basegame/ — Nuclide uses basegame=base, so keep
  the file at base/gfx/palette.lmp (repo root), not under base/id1/ (that layout is for TrenchBroom Quake profile).
-->
